WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
There are so many people in our factory

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,320
The food in the warehouse won't last long

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,720
The factory director’s secretary issued a death order

4
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:06,720
Let the Procurement Department do everything possible to get grain

5
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,720
Coarse grains, fine grains, sweet potatoes, potatoes and pumpkins

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,440
Anything that can fill your stomach is fine

7
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:12,760
Brother, I know this is difficult

8
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:13,880
Can be used throughout the entire factory

9
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:15,680
I can think of people who might have something to offer

10
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,460
only you

11
00:00:17,460 --> 00:00:19,660
Do you have any way?

12
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:22,590
Even if you do part of it first, you can save the day.

13
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:25,150
There is indeed a lot of food in space

14
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:28,110
Sweet Potatoes Corn Rice Millet

15
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:31,350
I really want to help the machinery factory get through this difficult situation.

16
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:33,030
Not impossible

17
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:34,830
But I took out too much at once

18
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:38,310
The source is not clear at all

19
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:40,880
Dear brother, the price is negotiable.

20
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:43,840
For coarse grains, the factory can give you one yuan and seventy million gold.

21
00:00:43,840 --> 00:00:45,320
Fine grains are counted separately

22
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:47,840
There are also industrial coupons to tighten material indicators.

23
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:50,680
As long as we can coordinate, the factory is willing to find a way.

24
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:53,560
Brother Gao, I’m not a brother who won’t help you.

25
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,360
It’s not entirely a question of price

26
00:00:55,360 --> 00:00:57,080
What is the situation with food now?

27
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:58,320
you know better than me

28
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,360
Get goods in bulk
